# GitHub repository — **Source:** lines (lesson `vi.md` / `en.md`)

When a lesson references **StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability**, the **Source:** paragraph must use **Markdown links with full URLs** (clickable in editors and rendered docs). Mirror the same **sentence shape** in **`vi.md`** and **`en.md`**. Do **not** prefix with **“repo demo”** / **“demo repository”** — start with **`Source:`** then the linked **`owner/name`**.

## Required links (monitoring module lessons with `/<lesson>/.docker/`)

Each **Source:** line must include **three** link targets:

1. **Repository root** (always):  
   `https://github.com/StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability`

2. **Lesson folder** on GitHub (`tree/<default-branch>/<lesson-slug>`):  
   `https://github.com/StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability/tree/main/<lesson-slug>`

3. **Compose / hands-on directory** (`tree/<default-branch>/<lesson-slug>/.docker`):  
   `https://github.com/StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability/tree/main/<lesson-slug>/.docker`

Use **`main`** in `tree/main/…` unless the repo’s default branch is confirmed to differ — then align the branch segment.

## Canonical template (copy shape; replace `<lesson-slug>`)

**Vietnamese (`vi.md`):**

```markdown
Source: [StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability](https://github.com/StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability) trên GitHub — thư mục bài học: [`<lesson-slug>`](https://github.com/StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability/tree/main/<lesson-slug>); **Docker Compose** và file hands-on nằm trong [`<lesson-slug>/.docker`](https://github.com/StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability/tree/main/<lesson-slug>/.docker).
```

**English (`en.md`):**

```markdown
Source: [StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability](https://github.com/StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability) on GitHub — lesson directory: [`<lesson-slug>`](https://github.com/StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability/tree/main/<lesson-slug>); **Docker Compose** and hands-on files live under [`<lesson-slug>/.docker`](https://github.com/StarCi-Academy/system-design-mastery-module-7-monitoring-and-observability/tree/main/<lesson-slug>/.docker).
```

Examples: **`<lesson-slug>`** = **`0-monitoring-and-observability`**, **`3-distributed-tracing`**, etc.

## Wording

In lesson body copy, prefer **repository** (hands-on tree on GitHub) over **lab** or **repo demo** for consistency with **`monitoring-lesson-docker-compose.mdc`**.

## Do not

- Do not leave **Source** as plain `owner/repo` text without links when this GitHub repository is meant.
- Do not collapse the lesson folder and **`.docker`** into a single link — keep **both** the lesson tree link and the **`<lesson-slug>/.docker`** link.
